    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d328">

                <pb facs="0452" n="364" xml:id="pg364"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3363: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Fernald</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-10-24T11:00:00-04:00">October 24, 1933—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>82. Dr. Carlos Calvo is appointed special envoy plenipotentiary leaving 27th for
                    Buenos Aires. Negotiations are very secret, but apparently Argentina and Brazil
                    have made peace proposal following Salamanca telegram of 12th.<anchor n="43"
                        xml:id="d328-f1"/> Local newspapers hopeful for armistice by November
                    11th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fernald</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d328-f1" n="43" xml:id="d328-f1-content">
                <p>In reply to the telegram of the Presidents of Argentina and Brazil of October 11.
                    The telegram in part states that the “Government of Bolivia shares your desires,
                    and is, as always, disposed to consider and accept every project which assures
                    peace on the foundation of justice, conciliating the fundamental interests of
                    two belligerent countries”. (724.3415/3365) The telegrams are printed in
                    Republica de Bolivia, Ministerio de Relaciones Exteriores y Culto, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Memoria presentada al Oongreso de 1934, Conflicto del
                        Chaco</hi>, p. 434.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
